     ```
   - Implement:
     * `new_round(&mut self, round_cards: u8, start_bidder: u8, rng: &mut impl Rng)`
     * `legal_bids_mask(&self, player: usize) -> u16` (11-bit mask for bids `0..=10`)
     * `legal_cards_mask(&self, player: usize) -> u64` (52-bit mask using O(1) bitboard ops:
       `let suit_mask = 0x1FFFu64 << (self.led_suit as usize * 13); let in_suit = hand & suit_mask; if in_suit != 0 { in_suit } else { hand }`)
     * `get_leader(&self) -> usize` (iterates `offset in 0..4`, `p = (self.start_bidder as usize + offset) % 4`, returns earliest highest bidder)
