         `toks[0] = BOS_TOK`, `toks[1] = BID_BASE + round_cards`. Then for each event in `history_events[..history_len]`:
         `rel_p = (abs_p + 4 - viewer) % 4`. Emit `PLAYER_BASE + rel_p`, then `BID_BASE + payload` (if bid) or `CARD_BASE + payload` (if play). Pad remaining up to 96 with `PAD_TOK (0)`.
       - **Features (`FEAT_DIM = 296`)**:
